      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> to render all <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/Link.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>Link</code></a>s contained in a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/RepresentationModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>RepresentationModel</code></a> as <code>text/uri-list</code> and\nparse a request of that media type back into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/RepresentationModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>RepresentationModel</code></a> instance.",
